3,1,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried the diggers will hit soft ground and delay everything. Who else is checking the site conditions?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I’m checking how the ground actually behaves underfoot. @Kenji, your timing worries are valid, but I’m focused on the daily reality of the space.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I’m trying to figure out who will actually look after the park every week.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I want to see what our past projects look like now, not just the drawings.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’m looking at the long-term upkeep costs. A beautiful opening is easy; keeping it running for years is where budgets usually break.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Minato, that’s a good point. I’m checking the firms tendering for earth-moving to see if they can handle the clay subsoil here.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I’m checking the drainage callouts and heat readings. I want to see if the ground can handle the weather we actually get.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I’m checking the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups to see who is really there to help.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I’m checking the condition of works from the earlier programme and the eastern avenue planting. I want to see what actually survived the last decade.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’m checking the upkeep ledger and the habitat fund terms. I need to know what this will cost the city to maintain once the ribbon is cut.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, do you think the drainage issues will make the ground too unstable for the diggers?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, not necessarily unstable, but the heat and drainage data suggest the ground is already stressed. We need to know if the plan fights that or works with it.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I hope the volunteers can help with the daily care. It feels like a lot of work for just a few people.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the volunteer groups are helpful, but I need to know if the core staff can sustain the workload.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, the ledger shows planted ground costs triple to maintain. I’m worried the fund won’t cover the long-term upkeep.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Jonathan, that’s a heavy number. I’m just hoping the two firms can finish the digging before the weather turns.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Jonathan, triple the cost is a serious constraint. I’m hoping the data shows we can design around the heat and drainage, not just pay for the damage.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Minato,,I’m glad we’re all looking at the same things. I just want to make sure the people who care for it are happy and not too tired.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Jonathan, the ledger is one thing, but I need to see if the physical structures actually held up. Let’s see what the data says.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I’ll wait for the full picture. If the fund only covers planting, the city pays the rest forever.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,1,,action,Kenji,,Regional firms tendering for earth-moving; Depot phasing notes on hoarding the site,"{""action"":""investigate"",""cards"":[""card_03"",""card_04""],""parse"":""ok""}"
